  "notes": [
    "The anchor is the attacker's first pledge-and-withdraw setup, which ran the defective withdrawNFT; the six borrow txs are in the campaign. Reset: XNFT.setController, which withdrawNFT calls; the controller's latest needed change is the xETH addPool listing.",
    "2,988 ETH left the xETH pool over 84 borrows. Reported figures of 3,087 ETH are the attacker EOA balance, which held pre-attack funds; the 1,467 ETH the attacker returned the next day is not netted. A 14926285 borrow unpause on the controller is a pause gate, not a reset."
